
                                 Play v1.0

Play is a tiny example in assembler of how to use the most common functions
in ptreplay.library.
Just assemble it with Devpav v3.02 or your own favourite assembler, some
adjustments may be done when using the later.

To use it:

15.Ram Disk:> Play SFX:Mod./Mod.95-Raver's Mix

And then it will play the module and wait for you to press CTRL_C to
stop it.